### ====================================================================
### HESTA Smart Home - Ti vi Thông Minh TCL (Smart TV) Test Suite
### ====================================================================
### Cấu hình thiết bị theo ESP32 Daikin64_BLE_MQTT.ino (Combo IR Hub):
### - Node ID:      32442d7f-dfcf-4b2f-a380-adba32876cec
### - TV Device ID: 7a9e5b3c-6d2f-4e8a-b1c4-9f8e7d6c5b4a
### - AC Device ID: 05d8a4fd-d7f1-4c62-a70e-a4213552b054
### - MQTT Topics:
###   + Lệnh TV (Subscribe):     hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
###   + Trạng thái TV (Publish): hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/state
###   + Xác nhận TV (ACK):       hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/ack
###   + Telemetry TV (Publish):  hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/telemetry
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceId = a756e94a-f3e5-49a9-80fe-b517b9749a9c
@acDeviceId = 05d8a4fd-d7f1-4c62-a70e-a4213552b054
@nodeId = 32442d7f-dfcf-4b2f-a380-adba32876cec
#@token = 

### ====================================================================
### 0. (Optional) Login to obtain JWT Bearer token if authentication is enabled
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "123123123"
}

> {%
    if (response.body && response.body.result && response.body.result.accessToken) {
        client.global.set("token", response.body.result.accessToken);
    }
%}

### ====================================================================
### 0.1 Xem thông tin & trạng thái hiện tại của TV trong Database
### ====================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ====================================================================
### 1. BẬT NGUỒN TV (Action: POWER_ON)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "POWER_ON",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 2. TẮT NGUỒN TV (Action: POWER_OFF)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "POWER_OFF",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 3. ĐẢO NGUỒN TV (Action: TOGGLE hoặc POWER)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "TOGGLE",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 4. CÀI ĐẶT NGUỒN TV (SET_POWER: power = true)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_POWER",
  "power": true,
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 5. CÀI ĐẶT NGUỒN TV (SET_POWER: power = false)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_POWER",
  "power": false,
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 6. TĂNG ÂM LƯỢNG (Action: VOL_UP)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "VOL_UP",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 7. GIẢM ÂM LƯỢNG (Action: VOL_DOWN)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "VOL_DOWN",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

