### 8. TẮT / BẬT TIẾNG (Action: MUTE)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "MUTE",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 9. TĂNG KÊNH (Action: CH_UP)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CH_UP",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
