### ====================================================================
### 10. GIẢM KÊNH (Action: CH_DOWN)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CH_DOWN",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 11. CHỌN KÊNH TRỰC TIẾP (Action: SET_CHANNEL -> channel: 5)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_CHANNEL",
  "channel": 5,
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

