### 12.5 Phím OK (Xác nhận)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "OK",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 13. CÁC PHÍM CHỨC NĂNG HỆ THỐNG (HOME, BACK, MENU, INPUT)
### ====================================================================
### 13.1 Phím HOME
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "HOME",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### 13.2 Phím BACK (Quay lại)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "BACK",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### 13.3 Phím MENU
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "MENU",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### 13.4 Phím INPUT (Nguồn phát tín hiệu / HDMI)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "INPUT",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 14. BẤM PHÍM SỐ TRỰC TIẾP (0 - 9)
### ====================================================================
### Bấm số 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "1",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### Bấm số 8
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "8",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 15. GỬI NÚT TÙY Ý QUA ACTION SEND_BUTTON (Kèm button: "VOL_UP", "POWER"...)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SEND_BUTTON",
  "button": "VOL_UP",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 16. PHÁT MÃ HỒNG NGOẠI THÔ (Action: SEND_IR_CODE, code: "0x0D5F2A")
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SEND_IR_CODE",
  "protocol": "NIKAI",
  "code": "0x0D5F2A",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 17. YÊU CẦU THIẾT BỊ GỬI TRẠNG THÁI TV MỚI NHẤT (Action: GET_STATE)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "GET_STATE",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 18. ĐIỀU KHIỂN TV QUA AC DEVICE ID VỚI CỜ TARGET: "tv"
### (Hữu ích khi gọi vào endpoint của AC nhưng muốn phát lệnh sang TV)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{acDeviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "target": "tv",
  "action": "VOL_UP",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 19. ĐIỀU KHIỂN TV QUA TIỀN TỐ ACTION TV_* TRÊN AC DEVICE ID
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{acDeviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "TV_POWER",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 20. LỊCH SỬ THAY ĐỔI TRẠNG THÁI CỦA TV
### ====================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
